        <mxCell id="9v7zMtN0XV_v5VDUjUib-22" value="&lt;br&gt;In Picking List Management:&lt;br&gt;- It is possible to select different part from the ones automatically allocate by AMOS via &quot;Take&quot; action&lt;br&gt;- It is possible to use the &lt;b&gt;&quot;two-step&quot; approach&lt;/b&gt; (confirmation from &quot;sender&quot;, who moves in Transit Location, then confirmation from &quot;receiver&quot;, who moves the parts to final store destination) or the &lt;b&gt;&quot;one-step&quot; approach&lt;/b&gt; (move the aprt directly to final store destination)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;flipV=1;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" parent="TVyqgcXE4ki6PRG703s3-1" vertex="1">
